			"description": "Pump Shotgun",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A civilian and militia pump-action scattergun common on agri and feral worlds and among hive gangers — a step down from the military combat shotgun, and the more commonly depicted shotgun among non-military characters in Imperial fiction.\n\nDesign: Same buckshot/slug split as the Combat Shotgun, toned down roughly half a die and locked to RoF 1 (manual pump cycling, no autofire) to reflect civilian manufacture rather than a military select-fire action.",
